# Build context hygiene: never send secrets, local data or build output to the Docker daemon.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
storage
apps/api/storage
**/*.log
playwright-report
test-results
e2e
docs
scripts
infra
docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
